# Local environment files for every example app. Populated by each app's
# scripts/dev.sh from `.env.example`; `.env.deployed` is rewritten on every
# stack deploy with the fresh contract addresses. They hold the deployer key
# (anvil account 0 in the demos) and must never be committed — copy the
# checked-in `.env.example` instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
